  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>靈魂字體</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款基於熱門遊戲《黑暗靈魂》系列、易於閱讀的哥德與中世紀風格字體，將進一步提升你的原版遊戲體驗。最初為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包製作，現已開放給大眾使用！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">字體基於 Manfred Klein 的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252foptimus-princeps-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optimus Princeps 字體</a> 製作。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字體採用免費字型授權。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/210/souls-font-characaters.PNG\" width=\"645\" height=\"734\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/209/2023-12-18_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友們一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗在等待...</span></p>",
